{"_id":"6aac83ff9fe200f7f3256854","title":"ESP, Aimbot, Triggerbot & Recoil | No Key | Upd 13.10.26","game":{"_id":"67e5e1ffb360710ec3c77e0e","gameId":292439477,"name":"[Fall Weapon Remodels!] Phantom Forces","imageUrl":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/91a6e73bce1724f25f63fd86a40d3c161d0e06f194381e9d905d38af13715428.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d79d03fe2eb591494e27e4526149e74d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"slug":"292439477-phantom-forces","path":"/game/292439477-phantom-forces","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/91a6e73bce1724f25f63fd86a40d3c161d0e06f194381e9d905d38af13715428.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d79d03fe2eb591494e27e4526149e74d/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"placeId":292439477},"slug":"Phantom-Forces-ESP-Aimbot-Triggerbot-and-Recoil-Control-or-Free-No-Key-228663","verified":false,"key":false,"keyless":false,"views":5075,"executes":11906,"scriptType":"free","isUniversal":false,"isPatched":false,"visibility":"public","indexUnlisted":false,"image":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ab34627024918018c3d22ae4631a0dddebda2781754b4035457db3d541b40ec1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/292439477-1789690879690.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/292439477-1789690879690.png"},"thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/ab34627024918018c3d22ae4631a0dddebda2781754b4035457db3d541b40ec1.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/sb/292439477-1789690879690.png","scriptblox":"https://scriptblox.com/images/script/292439477-1789690879690.png"},"likeCount":0,"dislikeCount":0,"createdAt":"2026-09-18T00:21:20.000Z","updatedAt":"2026-09-18T00:21:20.000Z","lastBump":"2026-09-18T00:21:20.000Z","script":"loadstring(game:HttpGet(\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx/main/loader.lua\"))()","features":"Phantom Forces fights being read harder than any other game this loader covers: the Players service is renamed, every character model and every part in it carries a random string, and the models are torn down and rebuilt several times a second. This script gets its identity and head position out of the nametag GUI and the team out of the scoreboard, and it never fires a remote.\n\nESP\nBox, box fill, name, distance, kills and deaths off the scoreboard, health bar, head dot, skeleton, tracers and through-wall chams. Visible-only and dim-hidden modes, a max-distance slider and a colour picker per element.\n\nAIM ASSIST\nHotkey, always, or only while you are firing. Head, torso or nearest part, sticky target, visible-only, an FOV circle and separate horizontal and vertical smoothing. It moves the real mouse rather than the camera, so nothing snaps.\nIt also does real ballistics: the game has bullet drop and travel time, so the script compensates the drop and leads moving targets - and it measures the bullet speed from your own shot instead of guessing it.\n\nTRIGGERBOT\nRandomised reaction delay, refire lockout, hit-chance roll, head-only mode and a pixel FOV.\n\nRECOIL CONTROL\nMeasures your own mouse sensitivity first, then pulls back only the part of the kick that was not your own hand.\n\nHUMANISER\nReaction delay, wind-up, wander, deadzone and a degrees-per-second speed ceiling, with Legit / Normal / Raw presets and a panic key.\n\nROUND PAGE\nLive scoreboard for both teams, match timer, game mode, and your own health, ammo and firemode.\n\nWHAT IT DOES NOT DO\nNo silent aim, no speed, no fly. All three were measured in this game and none of them work - every packet carries a rolling key that only exists inside the game's own Actor VM - so the script does not claim them.\n\nMOBILE\nThe panel asks PC or phone the first time it opens and scales itself to fit. German, English and Russian.\n\nHOW TO RUN\n1. Open Phantom Forces\n2. Paste the script into your executor\n3. Execute - the panel opens by itself\n4. Press RightShift to show or hide it\n\nFree, keyless, no ads, and it never spends Robux. Open source: https://github.com/seltonmt012/sel01-rbx",